  "_heroReadme": [
    "Hero shots are cut out of their studio backdrop so the shoe floats over the",
    "brand circle exactly like the reference. `tolerance` is how far a pixel may",
    "sit from the backdrop colour and still be keyed out: raise it when a halo of",
    "backdrop survives, lower it when the shoe itself starts eroding (white shoes",
    "on a white seamless need the lowest values)."
